   $q$In paragraph 4, "Scientists are still piecing together the puzzle." What does this phrase mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Scientists are gathering clues to slowly understand how pigeons find their way.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Scientists have fully solved how pigeons find their way home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Scientists have given up on studying how pigeons travel.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-extreme"},{"text":"Scientists use jigsaw puzzles to test how smart pigeons are.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Scientists are gathering clues to slowly understand how pigeons find their way.$q$, $q$The word "still" and the list of possible clues (the sun, magnetic field, landmarks) show the answer is not complete yet. That rules out the idea that scientists have fully solved it.$q$, 'draft', '1f1ed3c4-411a-5394-b541-ca3671e3ad70')
